  "question": "Can a development-only selected hard exact-area fallback threshold preserve group-held-out material-structure statistics better than the global P4H compiler while keeping exact fallback bounded?",
  "policy": {
    "family": "hard local-density-range exact-area fallback over P4H two-cumulant global compiler",
    "threshold_candidates": [0.02, 0.05, 0.1, 0.2, 0.4, 0.8],
